Optional daily limit on new contacts for campaigns in the campaign category
with alias "daily-limit", set in Configuration > Campaign Settings > Daily
Limit for New Contacts ("New contacts per campaign per sending day", parameter
campaign_daily_entry_limit). mautic:campaigns:update takes new contacts from
such a campaign's segments only when its first email can go: on a day, and
before the end of the hours, set on that step (in the default time zone). It
takes at most the limit a day, less those already due the first email on the
send day. The rest stay in the segment and join on later runs. Contacts
already in the campaign carry on as scheduled, and contacts added to a
campaign directly are not limited. A limit of 0 keeps the stock behaviour.

